  <sysml:Requirement xmi:id='nist_cand_RS-2_c13_st' base_Class='nist_cand_RS-2_c13' Id="CM-8" Text="[CANDIDATE, medium confidence] Implement CM-8 for RS-2. Proposed from D3FEND Asset Inventory, Container Image Analysis, Hardware Component Inventory (table entry 'Asset Inventory', technique); relevant attack-tree leaves: Adversary control of device on 1553 bus via supply chain to fly AV to adversary selected location; Adversary maliciously modifies flight-critical software during distribution to modify AV mission computer; Adversary substitutes flight-critical hardware during distribution to alter AV navigation system; Adversary supply chain attack on MX system provides logical access to maliciously alter AV mission computer. Rationale: technique entry 'Asset Inventory' in nist80053_d3fend.json: System component inventory with updates. (D3FEND countermeasure was medium-confidence)"/>
