  <sysml:Requirement xmi:id='nist_cand_RS-2_c15_st' base_Class='nist_cand_RS-2_c15' Id="CP-10" Text="[CANDIDATE, medium confidence] Implement CP-10 for RS-2. Proposed from D3FEND Restore Object, Restore Software, Restore Access (table entry 'Restore Object', technique); relevant attack-tree leaves: Adversary control of device on 1553 bus via supply chain to fly AV to adversary selected location; Adversary gets insider to give them the command link key to fly AV to adversary selected location; Adversary maliciously modifies flight-critical software during distribution to modify AV mission computer; Adversary supply chain attack on MX system provides logical access to maliciously alter AV mission computer. Rationale: technique entry 'Restore Object' in nist80053_d3fend.json: Backups, recovery, baseline configuration. (D3FEND countermeasure was medium-confidence)"/>
